    {
      "subId": "2503603",
      "subQuestName": "与凯塔对话",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250360301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250360301": {
            "id": "250360301",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "我想试试。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250360302"
            ]
          },
          "250360302": {
            "id": "250360302",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "唔，果决爽利，值得称赞。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503604",
      "subQuestName": "(test)判断全对成就用$HIDDEN",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250360401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250360401": {
            "id": "250360401",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "稍等一下…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250360402"
            ]
          },
          "250360402": {
            "id": "250360402",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "嗯，不急一时，我可静待。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503602",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250360201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250360201": {
            "id": "250360201",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "您准备好体验那些问题了吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503611",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250361101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250361101": {
            "id": "250361101",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "在群山之中，始终回响着「回声之子」的锻锤声。他们是优秀的匠人，坚忍的战士，再坚硬的岩石也无法阻挡他们的脚步。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250361102"
            ]
          },
          "250361102": {
            "id": "250361102",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "我的问题是。「回声之子」的伙伴们是谁？真名为何？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250361001",
              "250361002"
            ]
          },
          "250361001": {
            "id": "250361001",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "的确如此，毫无错漏。"
          },
          "250361002": {
            "id": "250361002",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "唔…略有差池，尚需思虑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503612",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250361201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250361201": {
            "id": "250361201",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "你见过那些通体鲜绿，善于在山崖之上飞奔疾行，在林间勾荡飞跃的「匿叶龙」吧？",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250361202"
            ]
          },
          "250361202": {
            "id": "250361202",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "我的问题是。「匿叶龙」所在的部族之名，是什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503613",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250361301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250361301": {
            "id": "250361301",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "在纳塔有一种事物。它可以用来辅助锻造，制作碟片…甚至还有不同的形态，时而为液态，时而为固态。而且，这种事物只在纳塔存在。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250361302"
            ]
          },
          "250361302": {
            "id": "250361302",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "我的问题是，这种事物的名字是什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503614",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250361401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250361401": {
            "id": "250361401",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "在流泉之上，浪海之侧，有着名为「流泉之众」的部族。这群开朗的好人热爱音乐，聚会和温泉，和他们在一起总是让人心情愉快。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250361402"
            ]
          },
          "250361402": {
            "id": "250361402",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "我的问题是，「流泉之众」的伙伴们是谁？真名为何？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503615",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250361501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250361501": {
            "id": "250361501",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "在纳塔，燃素存在于许多事物之中——甚至某些植物之中，也会存在燃素。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250361502"
            ]
          },
          "250361502": {
            "id": "250361502",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "我的问题是。在纳塔之中，有一种内部存在着燃素的蘑菇，这种蘑菇的名字是？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503616",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250361601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250361601": {
            "id": "250361601",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "在纳塔，燃素存在于许多事物之中——甚至某些植物之中，也会存在燃素。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250361602"
            ]
          },
          "250361602": {
            "id": "250361602",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "我的问题是。在纳塔之中，有一种内部存在着燃素的花卉，这种花卉的名字是？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503621",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250362101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250362101": {
            "id": "250362101",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "那么，请继续回答吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503622",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250362201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250362201": {
            "id": "250362201",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "唔，最后一个问题。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503623",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250362301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250362301": {
            "id": "250362301",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "您的回答尚有错漏，不甚完美…",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250362302"
            ]
          },
          "250362302": {
            "id": "250362302",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "唔…看来您还需要在纳塔多做游历。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250362303"
            ]
          },
          "250362303": {
            "id": "250362303",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "无需担心。未来与过去都会成为当下的答案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503624",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250362401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250362401": {
            "id": "250362401",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "您的回答无一错漏，完美无缺。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250362402"
            ]
          },
          "250362402": {
            "id": "250362402",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "愿智慧与您的旅途始终相伴。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250362403"
            ]
          },
          "250362403": {
            "id": "250362403",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "…我的问题，难道真的太简单了？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "2503625",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "250362501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "250362501": {
            "id": "250362501",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "…您有着给出答案的勇气，这一点可称优秀。",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "250362502"
            ]
          },
          "250362502": {
            "id": "250362502",
            "speakerId": 6019,
            "speakerName": "凯塔",
            "text": "请您继续在纳塔游历吧，我想，您一定能收获更多的答案。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}